# Boss_TurretPod_SpawnTurret1 with the object pool out of blocks (ruling 5, 2), at its first call
# (TAS f45122): its spawner Boss_TurretPod_CreateTurret1 $02F038 (Obj_SpawnBossUnlinked) finds no
# free block and fails (Z clear), so the pod skips the turret (bne $02910C: no var 0, no handle).
# A full pool is a state the game handles; the corpus never fills it (140 blocks).

case pool_empty
b $FFFFF4B0 = 0
